  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Angle between both lines<br/>$\\begin{aligned}<br/>& \\cos \\theta=\\left|\\frac{3+0-5}{\\sqrt{2} \\sqrt{50}}\\right| \\\\\n& \\sin \\theta=\\frac{2}{10}=\\frac{1}{5} \\\\\n& \\sin \\theta=\\frac{\\sqrt{24}}{5} \\\\\n& \\text { area }=\\frac{1}{2} a b \\sin \\theta \\\\\n& \\frac{1}{2} \\sqrt{15} \\sqrt{15} \\frac{\\sqrt{24}}{5}<br/>\\end{aligned}$<br/>square of area $\\frac{15.15 .24}{4.25}$<br/><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/ZcRAmHdBjzJJ5v3hdjAx18kzES6v61r7YtwiyX_nhw8.original.fullsize.png\"/><br/>option (1)",
    "image": null
